// Versilian Community Sample Library hihat: hi-hat, closed (unpitched). Samples: Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL), Versilian Studios, CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL).
// Generated by scripts/make_vcsl_library.py; sample paths are relative to the library's cache folder.
<control>
// volume: the median plain-velocity sample (loudest 400 ms) is -20 LUFS, its peak at most 0.7; dynamic layers keep their recorded levels.
<group> volume=15.9 ampeg_release=0.2 loop_mode=one_shot pitch_keytrack=0
